{"server":"tw","storyId":"act5d0_level_act5d0_06_beg","groupId":"act5d0","stageId":"act5d0_06","title":"10:26P.M.","storyCode":"CB-6","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_06_beg.txt","sourceHash":"f604287dfa0a0a1b52e6f34fec6c523d693125da7dff3afb051c1ddfd17da494","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二关（前）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"10:26 P.M.    天氣/多雲\n日落大道，“大地的盡頭”酒吧"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"那老闆，這瓶酒又是哪一年的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯哼，沉澱的色澤，悠久的香氣，後覺的甜味，綿長的口感，這是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"上個月在超市買來的便宜酒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"十猜十中耶，不愧是自稱龍門第一的品酒師！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"呸，說了多少遍了，這是儲備武器，不是用來喝的！空！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"好好好，這是漱口水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"欸......用炎國黃酒漱口嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"酒精的確可以消毒，吧台下面有工業酒精，能湊合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，有這個錢，不如買點別的好啦，花錢的精髓就在於過程，過程！和金額無關！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"各位，蘋果派烤好了！派對開始啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"哦~是能天使姐親手烤的派！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"乾杯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"......雖然不知不覺就變成這樣了，但這是什麼派對來著？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？拜松的歡迎會呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"......那拜松本人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！不知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"那就換個藉口，我們永遠不缺藉口。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......你們在做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"呃。在等你開派對，吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，歡迎來到大地的盡頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"遲到罰酒三杯，主角遲到翻三倍，但你不能喝酒，所以汽水九杯，請。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼要叫這個名字......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"（還有這個裝修風格，好閃亮.....為什麼還有企鵝......這是某種龐克藝術嗎......？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"別傻站著了，快進來，這可是你的歡迎派對，要不要蘋果派？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"原來在我和莫斯提馬小姐對付那些黑手黨的時候，你們卻在這裡開派對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼......那個頭目呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"讓他跑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"準確來說，是我准許他跑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"反正就是跑了......那接下來怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"敵人的數量，目的，身份，都已經很明顯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"來自敘拉古的黑手黨，想要奪取企鵝物流在龍門的勢力範圍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"......雖然我們應該是個物流公司......算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"不要放在心上，德克薩斯，總會有那麼幾天要用來清掃門戶的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"說這話就更不像是一個正經公司了哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"他們這是白費力氣啦，老闆的那些生意，就算拱手相讓他們也玩不來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"企鵝物流是不可取代的，而我更是不可取代的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"既然如此，我們有很多種解決方法，為什麼一定要和他們火拼起來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道......你們，一直以來是怎麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦好啦，不要這麼認真嘛，找個機會把他們的頭兒揍一頓扔進江裡，不就完事了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"這場鬧劇就和沒能睡著的回籠覺一樣浪費時間，我完——全提不起興趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"就是嘛，這可不是什麼值得認真討論的事情。來，口香糖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"但至少我們應該制定一個計畫......等等，這口香糖是什麼味道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"白馬醇味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"把這個牌子的口香糖列入危險品範疇吧，可頌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"看到新口味就進貨了，沒注意，誒嘿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你們派對還搞不搞了，有酒有菜，音樂呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"收到~！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"居然真的是爵士樂......出乎意料......雖然有點....."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"以前這裡的主人的確是個爵士樂愛好者啦，只是在轉讓給老闆之後發生了一些小小的風格變化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"小小的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"主要是因為老闆自己的唱片剛才全部被——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"停，不要讓我回憶起悲傷的往事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"說到底，誰讓他查出那種麻煩的病，我肯抽空來幫他照顧這家酒吧就不錯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"難道是礦石病？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"龍門經歷了那麼多事情，對感染者的態度應該轉變了不少才對......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"是酒精過敏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"對一個立志成為龍門最好的調酒師的傢伙而言，的確是絕症了呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼又有髒東西闖進來了，喂，你們幾個，想活命的立刻趴到吧台後面去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"得令！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，吧台下面有一枚硬幣，賺到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"不要亂動啦，這裡很窄——唔！能天使！你的光環！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"別發呆，拜松，趴下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"開火！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"唔啊，這下店裡可全毀了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"大帝先生好像還在外面，沒關係嗎！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"這些人怎麼就這麼死纏爛打，在店鋪被轟乾淨之前還擊啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，老闆，我的橡皮彈好像用完了，不如咱們抄凳子上？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"不是專門買了一批便宜酒放在這兒當武器的嗎！?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"欸、剛才喝的是最後一瓶了，剩下的都是值錢貨哎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"不管了，只有迂腐的老東西才會把美酒儲存在自己的宮殿裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"我們應該讓這些美妙的釀造物綻放，無論是價值層面，還是實體層面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"呃？但是那些藏酒的價格可非常——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"拿著，人手一瓶，記住，只砸頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"保護了我的酒吧，就是保護了這片大地，上吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"能天使。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"知道啦！抄瓶子砸人是吧，我擅長的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"等、等等我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他們衝出來了！小心！呃啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"十萬、十五萬、四十五萬，七十萬......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"那瓶多少來著？不！等等能天使！那瓶是——哎呀。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"這、這是......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"今晚的損失數字，不行，至少我們兩個還可以靠盾牌戰鬥，不能再讓損失擴大了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"明、明白！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"OK~三，二，一，上！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_101_sora","aliases":["空"]},{"speakerId":"char_102_texas","aliases":["德克薩斯"]},{"speakerId":"char_103_angel","aliases":["能天使"]},{"speakerId":"char_105_emper","aliases":["大帝"]},{"speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","aliases":["可頌"]},{"speakerId":"char_325_bison","aliases":["拜松"]}]}
